\n\
I have three lands on the battlefield: two Simic Growth Chambers and one Forest. I can produce G, U, or G.\n\
\n\
To play Catti-brie of Mithral Hall, I need GW. I can tap one Simic Growth Chamber for G and Forest for G, and then I have W missing, so I still can't play Catti-brie.\n\
\n\
To play Puresteel Paladin, I need WW. I don't have enough W, so I can't play Puresteel Paladin.\n\
\n\
