\n\
Since I have enough mana to play Curse of Verbosity if I use the right combination of lands, I'll consider playing it.\n\
\n\
To play Curse of Verbosity, I'll need to tap one Simic Growth Chamber for U and the other for G (or colorless), and then I'll still be missing 1 colorless mana. However, if I tap Forest for G and one Simic Growth Chamber for U, I'll be missing 1U and 1 colorless. I can tap the other Simic Growth Chamber for U (or G), which will give me the 2U needed if I use the right combination.\n\
\n\
However, I can play Ebony Fly, which costs 2 colorless. I can tap Forest and one Simic Growth Chamber to get the 2 colorless mana needed.\n\
\n\
I'll play Ebony Fly.\n\
