      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Mana Vault on turn 1 would enable casting Helm of Kaldra (3 mana) on turn 2 with just one more land drop, or Angelic Benediction (4 mana) on turn 2 with a land drop. The massive mana acceleration in a multiplayer game is significantly more valuable than a 1/1 with exalted. Akrasan Squire is a very low-impact creature in a 4-player Commander game and unlikely to deal meaningful damage. Mana Vault enables the deck's equipment/aura strategy much faster.",
